{"kind":"artifact","text":"The bounded status view carries the stale qualifier at exact clean head c472d46883ab99cf4b45e46de98fdeb8c014ec35. Commitment gains Stale, totals gain a parallel per-status stale count rather than conflating the qualifier with the lifecycle word, and satisfied or withdrawn rows are no longer skipped when stale — they surface under attention, because nobody owes a next move but the outcome needs re-checking. A stale reported commitment keeps its lane, its status word and its waiting party. The dead lane-table entry for \"requested\", a status the fold never emits, is removed.","body":{"commit":"c472d46883ab99cf4b45e46de98fdeb8c014ec35","path":"internal/statusview/view.go"}}